OL,3,AThe extreme engineering of aircraft
OL,4,Awindows
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn industrial nightmare was brewing
OL,7,Fsouth of Los Angeles.
OL,9,FIn late May, a chemical storage tank
OL,10,Fwith more than 7,000 gallons of toxic
OL,11,Fmaterial began heating up ` fast. The
OL,12,Ftank belonged to GKN Aerospace, a
OL,13,Fcompany that supplies parts to the
OL,14,Faviation industry, including aircraft
OL,15,Fwindows.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
