OL,3,AThe extreme engineering of aircraft
OL,4,Awindows
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the temperature inside the shiny
OL,7,Fmetal storage vessel rose, workers
OL,8,Frealised they had a problem. The tank
OL,9,Fwas at risk of exploding, potentially
OL,10,Fshowering nearby neighbourhoods with
OL,11,Fmethyl methacrylate (MMA), a skin and
OL,12,Flung-irritating compound used in
OL,13,Fplastics production.
OL,15,FThe tank's temperature reached 100F
OL,16,F(38C) ` though possibly went higher -
OL,17,F100F was simply the maximum reading on
OL,18,Fthe temperature gauge inside.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
